  m_text: Kessarin IV's surface is uneven, thick with mineral deposits that wreck
    normal traction. Your turret runs on a grip stabilized chassis built by Dara
    Voss, a former Red Bull F1 suspension engineer Command pulled in for the job.
    Expect tight, responsive handling even on loose or cracked terrain, so you can
    reposition fast without losing control mid fight.
