  m_text: The blaster fires charged plasma rounds, built on containment tech developed
    by Dr. Elias Kade. His work on stable plasma confinement earned him the Nobel
    Prize in Physics before Command recruited him to weaponize it. Each shot is compact,
    fast, and hits hard enough to crack through ore on contact.
