  m_text: You've been posted to Kessarin IV, a mining outpost on the edge of contested
    space. Its damaged gravitational array now sends asteroid fields drifting straight
    down into the colony, bouncing across the ground as they break apart. Your turret
    is the last line of defense; blast the rocks before they reach you, or Kessarin
    IV falls.
